  "summary": "天同巨门丑未同宫弱陷，天机由事业宫会照，夫妻太阴在亥或巳。作者认为须命与夫妻多吉无煞才稳定，会桃花及忌煞的负面说法含传统性别偏见；福德宫亦联系享受与聚财。会吉仍须行运配合才渐好，不把古说当现实职业或道德判断。",
  "summary_en": "Tian Tong and Ju Men share Chou or Wei in weak condition, with Tian Ji influencing them from Career and Tai Yin in Spouse at Hai or Si. The author requires strong benefic support without malefics in Life and Spouse for stability. Claims about women, material comfort and sexual occupations reflect the source’s traditional bias, not evidence about real people. Favorable stars still require supportive timing for gradual improvement.",
